'''Manic Dark Cat''' (大狂乱の暗黒ネコ ''Dai Kyōran no Ankoku Neko'', '''Insane Dark Cat''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy found in [[Unjust War (Deadly)|Unjust War]]. It was added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Manic Dark Cat
|image = E 244.png
|appearance = [[Unjust War (Deadly)]]
[[Infernal Tower/Floor 33|Infernal Tower - Floor 33]]
|money drop = 2,000¢ - 7,900¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has rapid, powerful attacks at medium range, with enough [[Freeze|freeze]] uptime to render its targets completely helpless, making it a very tough adversary. However, it's the least of your worries in its appearances compared to the nasty threats backed by it. Once all the support dies down, its health disappears at a surprisingly quick rate. Note the fewer knockbacks and health compared to [[Crazed Axe Cat (Enemy)|Crazed Axe Cat]] and lack of [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] trait.

